# Build context for backend/Dockerfile (context: repo root).
# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only what the API image needs.
# This keeps .env, data/, .git, .venv, frontend/ etc. out of the image.
*
!backend/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
# Required by pyproject.toml (readme = "README.md")
!README.md

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
